        "description": "Authenticated staff session with satisfied MFA. Unknown query/body fields return 422; no request body. Rate limited to 120 calls per identity per minute. No mutation, If-Match or Idempotency-Key is required. All reads are private, no-store. Convenience only: command authorization and candidate eligibility are independently rechecked inside the existing transaction. Disabled/nonstaff/ineligible identities are excluded. No email, auth/MFA metadata or unrelated grants are exposed. Use the returned parent ETag with the existing command; changed parent state can require refresh. Caller must be an active project_manager member, including callers with projects.read_all. Completed/cancelled parents return 409; on_hold remains eligible as in membership commands. Active members excluded. project_manager requires projects.read+transition+team.manage; business_analyst requires projects.read+manage; contributor requires projects.read. Permissions may be satisfied across multiple roles. Search is staff display name only.",
